# AI service domains for Clash
# Updated: 2026-04-07
# Notes:
# - "oprnrouter" is treated as OpenRouter.
# - This list is intentionally conservative: core product/API domains first,
#   plus a few vendor-documented auxiliary domains that are commonly required.

# OpenAI / ChatGPT
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,openai
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,chatgpt
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaiusercontent.com

# Anthropic / Claude
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,anthropic
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai

